          "text": "Cognitive and functional status"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient and daughter report slight increase in forgetfulness with dates and misplacing items. Independent with basic ADLs and needs prompting for some IADLs, especially bills; medications are in a Webster pack. Oriented to person and place, knows month and year, but unsure of exact date, similar to prior memory clinic assessment."
      }
