          "text": "Mental state examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Alert, pleasant, cooperative, mildly anxious and restless, with eye contact. Speech normal in rate and volume, somewhat pressured when discussing health worries. Mood 'worried'; affect anxious, congruent and reactive. Thought form linear but perseverative on health worries; prominent health anxiety about cancer and dementia. No delusions or hallucinations. Insight and judgement appropriate."
      }
